{"w":["2026-11-02","2026-11-08"],"built":"2026-11-02T21:00Z","pending":116,"N":["","Nature's Way NZ describes its Pea Protein powder as a \"low-allergen, vegan protein\".","Nature's Way NZ Acai Powder: \"Gluten free, dairy free, vegan, Non GMO, soy free.\"","Nature's Way NZ Matcha Powder: \"Gluten free, dairy free, vegan, Non GMO, no added sugar.\"","Woolworths NZ pack claim lists \"Vegan\" for these turmeric tablets.","Nature's Way NZ Beetroot Powder: \"Gluten free, dairy free, vegan, Non GMO.\"","Nature's Way NZ Kids Superfood Shake: \"Gluten free, dairy free, vegan, Non GMO, soy free.\"","Nature's Way NZ Spirulina Powder: \"Gluten free, dairy free, vegan, Non GMO, soy free.\"","Nature's Way NZ Kale Powder: \"Vegan, gluten-free, dairy free and non GMO.\"","Ben & Jerry's Australian flavour page shows a Vegan badge for the non-dairy Chocolate Chip Cookie Dough.","Twinings' English Breakfast product page (10/50/100 bags) shows a \"Vegan\" badge; ingredient is black tea.","Uncle Tobys' product page marks Shredded Wheat as \"Vegan friendly\"; ingredient is 100% whole grain wheat.","Kellogg's NZ product page states \"Suitable for vegans.\"","Barker's product page shows a Vegan dietary badge for this fruit tea syrup.","Tip Top calls this its \"Chocolate Vegan Trumpet\"; soy-based, with a may-contain-milk warning from shared production lines.","Chelsea FAQ: nearly all its sugars and syrups suit vegans; the only exception is Honey Maple Flavoured Syrup.","Farrah's FAQ: all its wraps and tortillas, except Garlic Butter Wraps, are suitable for vegetarians and vegans.","Uncle Tobys' product page marks Cheerios Original as \"Vegan friendly\".","Bundaberg's FAQ lists Lemon, Lime & Bitters among the beverages \"suitable for vegans\".","Bundaberg's FAQ lists Refreshingly Light Apple + Lychee among the beverages \"suitable for vegans\".","Bundaberg's FAQ lists Diet Ginger Beer among the beverages \"suitable for vegans\".","Fry's Chicken-Style Burgers page: \"Made from a blend of soy, wheat and pea protein they are 100% vegan.\"","Bundaberg's FAQ lists Ginger Beer among the beverages \"suitable for vegans\".","Bundaberg's FAQ lists Blood Orange among the beverages \"suitable for vegans\".","The Woolworths NZ pack claim says \"Vegan friendly\"; ingredients list no animal products.","Alpro's Barista Soya product page lists Vegan and Vegetarian among its key benefits.","Woolworths NZ description: \"naturally gluten-free, vegan & GMO free\".","Woolworths NZ description: \"Our cider vinegar crisps are 100% vegan and gluten free\".","Woolworths NZ pack claim lists \"vegan; gluten free; GMO free\".","Majans NZ FAQ: \"Bhuja snacks are suitable for Vegans and Vegetarians\"; this mix carries a Vegan friendly badge.","Leggo's product page states \"Suitable for vegans and vegetarians\".","Otis FAQ: all its products are made using \"vegan and vegetarian friendly ingredients, right down to our fortified vitamins\".","Mingle's Mexican Fiesta product page lists it as \"Vegan Friendly\"; ingredients are spices and salt.","Vitasoy's Protein Plus product page states \"suitable for vegetarians and vegans\".","PETA Australia lists Pringles Original as accidentally vegan, but Pringles makes no vegan claim and its Original Minis list emulsifier 471; check first.","Emma & Tom's FAQ states: \"All of our products are vegan friendly.\"","TREK's Biscoff bar page: \"Each bar delivers 9g of plant-based protein, is a source of fibre and vegan.\"","Vitasoy's Oat Milk Unsweetened page states \"Suitable for vegetarians and vegans.\"","PETA Australia's Accidentally Vegan list includes Pringles BBQ.","TREK's Salted Caramel oat bar page lists Vegan among its highlights; may contain traces of milk.","Raglan Food Co's FAQ calls it \"our vegan coconut yoghurt\"; the Vanilla Bean 150g pottle uses live vegan cultures.","PETA Australia lists Oreo Classic as accidentally vegan, but Oreo's own FAQ calls it lacto-vegetarian (may contain milk), not vegan.","PETA Australia lists Oreo Chocolate as accidentally vegan, but Oreo's own FAQ calls it lacto-vegetarian (may contain milk), not vegan."],"S":["Woolworths label","Nature's Way (manufacturer)","Woolworths NZ listing (pack claim)","Ben & Jerry's (manufacturer)","Twinings (manufacturer)","Uncle Tobys (manufacturer)","Kellogg's (manufacturer)","Barker's (manufacturer)","Tip Top (manufacturer)","Chelsea (manufacturer)","Farrah's (manufacturer)","Bundaberg (manufacturer)","Fry's (manufacturer)","Alpro (manufacturer)","Majans (manufacturer)","Leggo's (manufacturer)","Otis (manufacturer)","Mingle (manufacturer)","Vitasoy (manufacturer)","PETA Australia","Emma & Tom's (manufacturer)","Trek (manufacturer)","Raglan Food Co (manufacturer)"],"U":["","https://naturesway.co.nz/products/pea-protein-powder/","https://naturesway.co.nz/products/natures-way-acai-powder-75gm?variant=47804154282210","https://naturesway.co.nz/products/natures-way-matcha-green-tea-powder-50g","https://naturesway.co.nz/products/natures-way-beetroot-powder-100g","https://naturesway.co.nz/products/natures-way-kids-superfood-shake-75g","https://naturesway.co.nz/products/natures-way-spirulina-powder-120g","https://naturesway.co.nz/products/natures-way-kale-powder-120g","https://www.benandjerry.com.au/flavours/chocolate-chip-cookie-dough-non-dairy","https://twinings.com.au/products/english-breakfast","https://www.uncletobys.com.au/products/cereals/shredded-wheat/shredded-wheat","https://www.kelloggs.co.nz/en_NZ/products/nutri-grain-product.html","https://barkers.co.nz/shop/feijoa-lime-500ml","https://www.tiptop.co.nz/trumpets/vegan-gluten-free-choc","https://www.chelsea.co.nz/about-sugar/faqs/","https://www.farrahs.co.nz/faqs","https://www.kelloggs.co.nz/en_NZ/products/sultana-bran-product.html","https://www.uncletobys.com.au/products/cereals/uncle-tobys-cheerios/original","https://www.bundaberg.com/en-us/faqs/","https://fryfamilyfood.com/au/chicken-style-burgers","https://www.alpro.com/en-gb/products/drinks/alpro-barista-soya","https://majans